    "steam_appid": 3386700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1741980373\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>When a group of shipwreck survivors wash up on the shores of a strange quiet island, the last thing they expected was a miracle. With no supplies and no idea where to get food, the settlers begin searching for help before stumbling across a sleeping stone automaton. When one brave settler takes a closer look, the stone giant awakens and offers to help the villagers build a home. <br><br>Cobble: The Stone Forager is an adventure resource-gathering game where you play as the friendly stone giant, Cobble. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1741980373\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Help the shipwrecked settlers build up their town by gathering and foraging for supplies. <br></li><li>Unlock new areas and trade with the settlers to get stronger materials. <br></li><li>Rediscover the story of Cobble's creator and rebuild what has been lost.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1741980373\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1741980373\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>When a group of shipwreck survivors wash up on the shores of a strange quiet island, the last thing they expected was a miracle. With no supplies and no idea where to get food, the settlers begin searching for help before stumbling across a sleeping stone automaton. When one brave settler takes a closer look, the stone giant awakens and offers to help the villagers build a home. <br><br>Cobble: The Stone Forager is an adventure resource-gathering game where you play as the friendly stone giant, Cobble. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1741980373\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Help the shipwrecked settlers build up their town by gathering and foraging for supplies. <br></li><li>Unlock new areas and trade with the settlers to get stronger materials. <br></li><li>Rediscover the story of Cobble's creator and rebuild what has been lost.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386700/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1741980373\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "short_description": "Gather resources and explore to help lost settlers build a new home in this relaxing, foraging RPG.",
